======================================================================

                      Changes for Tclpp package

	          The Tclpp Home Page is located at

           http://www.geocities.com/ssinnige/projects/tclpp/

======================================================================

2.0     [June 28, 2000]
	- support or Windows platforms

2.0b2   [Feb 12, 2000]
	- The object command is now available in constructors
	- Base class variables accessible in derived classes
	- Added tclppvars
	- Added a tclppConfig.sh for easy tclpp extension building
	- Added pre-build man-pages and html documentation 
	- Added 'make install'

2.0b1	[Sep 17, 1999]
	- Redesign in 'C' for better performance and implementation of
  	  future enhancements

1.2     [Aug 05, 1998]
	- Added 'new' and 'delete' commands
	- Added nested class definition
	- Using pkgIndex.tcl instead of tclIndex for version support
	- Added MS Windows package

1.1.1	[May 19, 1998]
	- Corrected passing of multiple arguments to a constructor
	  Thanks to Alex Rezinsky <alexr@msil.sps.mot.com>
	- Corrected accessibility of inherited data members
	  
1.1	[April 21, 1998]
	- Released Tclpp version 1.1 using different name to avoid name
	  clashing with another tcl++ package.

1.0	[April 20, 1998]
	- Released Tcl++ version 1.0
	
